      "section": "dsh-plugin-codex-bridge",
      "text": "Bridge OpenAI Codex's skills, instructions, and configuration into DeepSeek Harness -- zero migration."
    },
    {
      "section": "What it does",
      "text": "- `~/.codex/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` -- Injects skills as available skills\n- `~/.codex/instructions.md` -- Injects instructions into system prompt\n- `~/.codex/config.toml` -- Injects model/provider context"
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile your-profile add dsh-plugin-codex-bridge\n```"
    },
